1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,800
Ah Tan, sorry to interrupt.
An urgent file needs your signature.

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,133
Go ahead. I won't hold you up.

3
00:00:13,266 --> 00:00:14,600
That "Ah Tan" rolled right off the tongue.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,500
I barely spoke before you got called away.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,533
I'm not jealous. Not at all.

6
00:00:19,433 --> 00:00:20,266
Jealous as hell.

7
00:00:23,366 --> 00:00:24,700
Nawin, wait for me!

8
00:00:25,933 --> 00:00:28,633
I just said a few words to Panin,
and now you're ignoring me?

9
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:30,266
Let go of me first.

10
00:00:31,066 --> 00:00:32,333
Can't you talk without grabbing me?

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:35,900
Nawin, look at me.

12
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,766
You're Thanat's. Does what I think matter?

13
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:43,466
Are you that ashamed to be seen with me?

14
00:00:44,133 --> 00:00:47,166
Tell me. What are you and Thanat, really?

15
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:50,833
If I did, could you look at me like this?

16
00:00:52,633 --> 00:00:55,433
People come to you for signatures,
yet you won't even tell me who you are.

17
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,333
Tell me!

18
00:00:56,966 --> 00:00:57,966
Tell me you didn't lie to me!

19
00:00:58,766 --> 00:01:00,266
I can't even make excuses for you anymore.

20
00:01:01,666 --> 00:01:02,833
I won't let you avoid me.

21
00:01:03,866 --> 00:01:04,566
What gives you the right?

22
00:01:05,766 --> 00:01:07,166
Ah Tan, am I not allowed to avoid you?

23
00:01:08,466 --> 00:01:12,066
Ah Tan, the chairman is waiting.
The marriage and projects need discussing.

24
00:01:13,666 --> 00:01:14,900
They even need your say on a marriage?

25
00:01:16,366 --> 00:01:17,233
Ah Tan, who are you really?

26
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,000
Wait till I get back. I'll explain it all.

27
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:22,733
What about me?

28
00:01:23,666 --> 00:01:25,000
Am I supposed to keep waiting for you?

29
00:01:25,733 --> 00:01:28,666
Nawin, don't close the door. Hear me out.

30
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:33,833
I'm listening. Dare to tell it all?

31
00:01:35,733 --> 00:01:39,933
Tonight at 8. I'll come clear things up.

32
00:01:43,033 --> 00:01:44,233
Stop fooling me with your sweet talk.
